[Inflections]
Word: !и, !к, !в, !для, !за, !на, !от

#       ADJECTIVES     NOUNS
MascSg: -ый, -ий, -ой, X,  -й, -ь, X,  X,  X,  X
FemSg:  -ая, -ья, -ая, X,  X,  X,  -а, -я, X,  X
NeutSg: -ое, -ье, -ое, X,  X,  X,  X,  X,  -o, -е
MascPl: -ые, -ьи, -ые, -ы, -и, -и, X,  X,  X,  X
FemPl:  -ые, -ьи, -ые, X,  X,  X,  -ы, -и, X,  X
NeutPl: -ые, -ьи, -ые, X,  X,  X,  X,  X,  -a, -я

# Help, I don't speak this language! If you do, what are some common words that
# would fall into the above table, but actually be incorrect?
# If you know of any that would show up in Terraria, check out the other .lplus
# files to learn how to use <Exceptions> and also [Items]!
# - ̈q

[Prefixes]

# This is a common change for all vanilla languages;
# 'Light' the adjective was unanimously translated as either the noun, or a transliteration, in other languages.

<Light:Лёгкий>

# Other changes

# Slow was translated as 'slowness' for some reason. This is shared with some other languages.
<Slow:Медленный>